<%- include('../partials/header', { title: 'Email Verification Status' }) %>

<div style="max-width: 520px; margin: 3rem auto;">
  <div class="panel">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <div class="brand-monogram" style="margin: 0 auto 1rem; width: 44px; height: 44px; font-size: 1.35rem; background: var(--accent-primary); color: var(--text-inverted);">✉</div>
      <div class="eyebrow">IDENTITY VERIFICATION STATUS</div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Email Verification Status</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">System authentication and dispatch pipeline documentation.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="background: var(--bg-surface-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--border-medium); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">
        <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted);">BACKEND CAPABILITY STATUS</span>
        <span class="tag-mono" style="color: var(--accent-amber); border-color: var(--color-strong-divider);">NOT IMPLEMENTED</span>
      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.5;">
        <strong>Email verification is not currently implemented as a backend capability.</strong> In the existing MongoDB/Mongoose architecture, user accounts are provisioned with <code>isActive: true</code> immediately upon registration.
      </p>

      <ul style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.6;">
        <li>No email verification database tokens or expiration schemas exist in the backend.</li>
        <li>No verification API routes or confirmation endpoints exist on the server.</li>
        <li>Authentication and session management rely directly on HttpOnly JWT cookies issued upon valid registration or login.</li>
      </ul>

      <div style="border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-terracotta); padding-left: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg-surface); padding-top: 0.5rem; padding-bottom: 0.5rem;">
        <strong>Operational Access:</strong> You may proceed directly to login or your society dashboard with your registered email and password.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;">
      <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">
        <span>Proceed to Operational Dashboard &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/login" class="btn btn-outline" style="width: 100%;">
        <span>Return to Login</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem; text-align: center; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
    SPECIFICATION NOTE · DIRECT ACTIVE ONBOARDING CONTRACT
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
